# Implementation Plan - Add Translations to Reviews Component and Data

We will add internationalization (i18n) support to the Reviews carousel section, the community reviews page, and individual review cards using `react-i18next`. We will also add the exact translations for all review texts and UI strings across all 12 language JSON files.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend Data

Since `reviews.ts` and `reviews.js` are static data files and cannot use React hooks directly, we will translate the reviews dynamically inside the React components by wrapping the fields (`review.text`, `review.comment`, and `review.supplierResponse`) in the `t()` function. We will keep the data files clean and standard.

