### Translation Files

We will write a Node.js script to automatically generate high-quality translations for all extracted reviews and UI strings and insert them into the 12 target language JSON files in `apps/frontend/translations/`.

Target languages: `en`, `tr`, `ar`, `fr`, `hi`, `es`, `et`, `de`, `zh-hans`, `zh-hant`, `ur`, `tl`.

